      "value": "UTS2 and UTS3 has the problem with Transparent Clipping in Mirrors\n\nAfter 3 hours of reading shader code and experiments, i got the results\n\nChanging in Shader:\n\nBlend SrcAlpha OneMinusSrcAlpha (UTS2: 172 for Outline and 196 for ForwardBase) (UTS3: 1437 and 1492)\n\nto\n\nBlend SrcAlpha OneMinusSrcAlpha, OneMinusDstAlpha One\n\non on outline and ForwardBase, solved the issue\n\nSo mostly it's Shader issue, but, maybe this information will help to VRC Mirror Engineers could do something with this and able to prevent this from not good shaders result\n\nI also reported it to the UTS developers\n\nThe last 2 Pics is result of Fixing on Shader Level, but hope it's possible to fix on Mirror Lvl as well",
